    {
      "id": 4123,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 760],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 44,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Angles: a set of 4 views of a subject with Qwen Image Edit 2511",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Angles: a set of 4 views of a subject with Qwen Image Edit 2511\n\nDraws your subject from 4 views in one run, one branch of Qwen Image Edit 2511 with the Multiple Angles LoRA and the Lightning LoRA per view, and saves the 4 images as one batch. Each branch sets its side, height, distance and seed.\n\n## Models\n\n- [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Qwen2.5-VL 7B text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct).\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors): Qwen Image VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI).\n- [Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning/resolve/main/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2511 Lightning 4-step LoRA, by lightx2v, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning).\n- [qwen_image_edit_2511_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Edit_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/qwen_image_edit_2511_bf16.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2511, bf16, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511).\n- [qwen-image-edit-2511-multiple-angles-lora.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/fal/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Multiple-Angles-LoRA/resolve/main/qwen-image-edit-2511-multiple-angles-lora.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2511 Multiple Angles LoRA, by fal, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/fal/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Multiple-Angles-LoRA).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
